ode_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","number":25,"title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":343,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T06:28:22Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":6,"created_at":"2026-06-17T16:34:23Z","updated_at":"2026-09-15T22:57:11Z","closed_at":"2026-09-15T22:57:11Z","assignee":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7.rc3\n- Not reproducible in 4.7.beta3, 4.6.x\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc3 - macOS Tahoe (26.3.1) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Metal (Forward+) - integrated Apple M1 Pro (Apple7) - Apple M1 Pro (10 threads) - 16.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe following classes are listed in `ClassDB.get_class_list()` \n* `IPUnix`\n* `GodotNavigationServer2D`\n* `NativeMenuMacOS`\n\nbut if you make reference to them you get the error \n```\nSCRIPT ERROR: Parse Error: Identifier \"xxxx\" not declared in the current scope.\n```\nThis appears to have been introduced since 4.7 Beta 3.\n\n\n## Issue affecting existing code\nIn [GUT (testing framework)](https://github.com/bitwes/Gut/) I need a dictionary of class names and references to the classes themselves (i.e. `{\"AStar2D\": AStar2D, \"Area2D\": Area2D, ...}`).  I use `ClassDB` to generate this dictionary.  In the previous versions of Godot, I have been able to use `can_instantiate` and a hardcoded list of Singletons to filter out classes I shouldn't reference.  I have been unable to find a way to filter these out of the list other than creating a black list.\n\nManaging a black list of class names is feasible, but based on the names of `IPUnix` and `NativeMenuMacOS` I'm concerned that there are class names that exist for other operating systems that I don't know about.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nMake a script that references any of the listed classes while the classes appear in `ClassDB.get_class_list()`.  \n\nI'm not sure if `IPUnix` and `NativeMenuMacOS` are included in `ClassDB.get_class_list()` on all platforms.  `GodotNavigationServer2D` might be universal.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nSee steps to reproduce.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120370/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}